      "fix_text": "Configure PostgreSQL to produce audit records when unsuccessful attempts to add privileges occur.\n\nAll denials are logged by default if logging is enabled. To ensure logging is enabled, review supplementary content APPENDIX-C for instructions on enabling logging."
